Package: glmheaders
Type: Package
Title: 'OpenGL Mathematics' C++ Headers
Version: 1.0.1-1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tyler", "Morgan-Wall", email = "tylermw@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3131-3814")),
    person("G-Truc Creation", role = c("aut", "cph"),
        comment = "GLM library"))
Description: Provides the header-only 'OpenGL Mathematics' ('GLM') library
    for use by other R packages. Includes vector and matrix types, geometric
    transformations, quaternions, and mathematical functions following the
    conventions of the 'OpenGL Shading Language'. An OpenGL installation is
    not required. Packages using these headers should list 'glmheaders' in
    their 'LinkingTo' field. The upstream library is available at
    <https://github.com/g-truc/glm>.
